<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark">
  <title>AI Governance Risk Diagnostic | MLA Group</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/jspdf/2.5.1/jspdf.umd.min.js"></script>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { background-color: #001a3a; color-scheme: dark; }
    body {
      background-color: #001a3a;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
    }
    .bg-glow {
      position: fixed; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 0;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 0%, rgba(26,107,255,0.2) 0%, transparent 65%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse 40% 40% at 80% 80%, rgba(26,107,255,0.08) 0%, transparent 60%);
    }
    .bg-grid {
      position: fixed; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; z-index: 0;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(rgba(26,107,255,0.07) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(26,107,255,0.07) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 60px 60px;
    }
    .page { position: relative; z-index: 1; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }

    /* NAV */
    nav {
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      padding: 24px 48px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      background-color: rgba(0,26,58,0.85);
      position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }
    nav img { height: 28px; max-width: 120px; width: auto; display: block; }
    .nav-back {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 500;
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    .nav-back:hover { color: #ffffff; }

    /* PROGRESS */
    .progress-wrap {
      background-color: rgba(0,26,58,0.7);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      padding: 12px 48px;
      display: none;
      position: sticky; top: 77px; z-index: 99;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }
    .progress-wrap.visible { display: block; }
    .progress-meta { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .progress-label {
      font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #3d8bff;
    }
    .progress-count { font-size: 0.75rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35); }
    .progress-track { height: 2px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 2px; overflow: hidden; }
    .progress-fill {
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1a6bff, #3d8bff);
      border-radius: 2px; transition: width 0.4s ease;
    }

    /* WRAPPER */
    .wrapper { max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 60px 32px 80px; width: 100%; }

    /* SCREENS */
    .screen { display: none; }
    .screen.active { display: block; animation: fadeUp 0.5s ease forwards; }
    @keyframes fadeUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px); }
      to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    /* BADGE */
    .badge {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      background-color: rgba(26,107,255,0.15);
      border: 1px solid rgba(26,107,255,0.35);
      color: #3d8bff;
      font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 7px 16px; border-radius: 100px; margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .badge-dot {
      width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%;
      background-color: #3d8bff; display: inline-block;
      animation: pulse 2s infinite;
    }
    @keyframes pulse { 0%,100%{opacity:1} 50%{opacity:0.3} }

    /* LANDING */
    .landing-hero { text-align: center; padding: 20px 0 44px; }
    .landing-hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem); font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 20px; color: #ffffff;
    }
    .h1-highlight { color: #3d8bff; }
    .landing-hero p {
      font-size: 1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
      line-height: 1.7; max-width: 520px;
      margin: 0 auto 40px; font-weight: 300;
    }
    .landing-features { display: grid; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 36px; text-align: left; }
    .lf-item {
      display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px;
      padding: 20px 22px;
      background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      border-radius: 12px;
      transition: border-color 0.25s, background-color 0.25s;
    }
    .lf-item:hover { border-color: rgba(26,107,255,0.3); background-color: rgba(26,107,255,0.05); }
    .lf-icon {
      width: 44px; height: 44px; min-width: 44px;
      background-color: rgba(26,107,255,0.15);
      border: 1px solid rgba(26,107,255,0.3);
      border-radius: 10px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    }
    .lf-icon svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; display: block; }
    .lf-text h4 { font-size: 0.93rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #ffffff; }
    .lf-text p { font-size: 0.82rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); line-height: 1.55; }

    /* BUTTONS */
    .btn-primary {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px;
      width: 100%; padding: 16px 32px;
      background-color: #1a6bff; color: #ffffff;
      border: none; border-radius: 8px;
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none;
      transition: background-color 0.2s, transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
      -webkit-appearance: none;
    }
    .btn-primary:hover {
      background-color: #2575ff; transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(26,107,255,0.35);
    }
    .btn-secondary {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px;
      padding: 14px 26px;
      background-color: transparent; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18); border-radius: 8px;
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s, background-color 0.2s;
      -webkit-appearance: none;
    }
    .btn-secondary:hover { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35); color:#ffffff; background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.04); }
    .nav-btns { display: flex; gap: 12px; margin-top: 8px; }
    .nav-btns .btn-secondary { width: auto; min-width: 90px; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .nav-btns .btn-primary { flex: 1; }

    /* CARDS */
    .card {
      background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      border-radius: 12px; padding: 32px 28px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    }
    .card::before {
      content: ''; position: absolute; top:0; left:0; right:0; height:2px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1a6bff, transparent);
    }
    .section-label {
      font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase; color: #3d8bff;
      font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .section-title { font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .section-desc { font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 28px; font-weight: 300; }

    /* QUESTIONS */
    .q-block { margin-bottom: 26px; padding-bottom: 26px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); }
    .q-block:last-of-type { margin-bottom: 20px; padding-bottom: 0; border-bottom: none; }
    .q-label { font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.55; color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .q-num { display: block; font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; color: #3d8bff; letter-spacing: 1px; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 5px; }
    .q-hint { font-size: 0.77rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.38); margin-bottom: 10px; font-style: italic; font-weight: 300; }
    .options { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 7px; }
    .option {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;
      padding: 11px 15px;
      background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 0.86rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      transition: all 0.2s; user-select: none;
    }
    .option:hover { background-color:rgba(26,107,255,0.08); border-color:rgba(26,107,255,0.3); color:#ffffff; }
    .option.selected { background-color:rgba(26,107,255,0.12); border-color:#1a6bff; color:#ffffff; }
    .option-dot {
      width:16px; height:16px; border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
      border-radius:50%; flex-shrink:0;
      display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .option.selected .option-dot { border-color:#1a6bff; background-color:#1a6bff; }
    .option.selected .option-dot::after { content:''; width:5px; height:5px; background:white; border-radius:50%; }
    .option.cb .option-dot { border-radius:4px; }
    .option.cb.selected .option-dot::after { content:'✓'; font-size:0.6rem; font-weight:700; width:auto; height:auto; background:none; border-radius:0; }

    /* FORMS */
    .form-group { margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .form-label { display:block; font-size:0.8rem; font-weight:600; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65); margin-bottom:7px; }
    .form-input, .form-select {
      width:100%; padding:12px 15px;
      background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      border-radius:8px; color:#ffffff;
      font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;
      font-size:0.88rem; font-weight:400;
      outline:none; transition:border-color 0.2s, background-color 0.2s;
      -webkit-appearance:none; appearance:none;
    }
    .form-input::placeholder { color:rgba(255,255,255,0.25); }
    .form-input:focus, .form-select:focus { border-color:#1a6bff; background-color:rgba(26,107,255,0.06); }
    .form-select option { background:#001a3a; color:#ffffff; }
    .form-row { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:12px; }
    .error-msg { font-size:0.78rem; color:#ff5555; margin-top:10px; margin-bottom:4px; display:none; }

    /* RESULTS */
    .result-top {
      text-align:center; padding:36px 28px 28px;
      background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      border-radius:12px; margin-bottom:20px;
      position:relative; overflow:hidden;
    }
    .result-top::before { content:''; position:absolute; top:0; left:0; right:0; height:2px; background:linear-gradient(90deg,#1a6bff,transparent); }
    .risk-badge {
      display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
      padding:7px 18px; border-radius:100px;
      font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:1.5px; text-transform:uppercase;
      margin-bottom:20px;
    }
    .risk-badge::before { content:''; width:7px; height:7px; border-radius:50%; background:currentColor; animation:pulse 2s infinite; }
    .risk-badge.critical { background-color:rgba(255,59,48,0.12); border:1px solid rgba(255,59,48,0.4); color:#ff5555; }
    .risk-badge.high     { background-color:rgba(255,59,48,0.1);  border:1px solid rgba(255,59,48,0.35); color:#ff7070; }
    .risk-badge.moderate { background-color:rgba(255,159,10,0.1); border:1px solid rgba(255,159,10,0.35); color:#ff9f0a; }
    .risk-badge.low      { background-color:rgba(48,209,88,0.1);  border:1px solid rgba(48,209,88,0.3);  color:#30d158; }
    .score-ring {
      width:110px; height:110px; border-radius:50%;
      margin:0 auto 20px;
      display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
      border:3px solid;
    }
    .score-ring.critical { border-color:#ff5555; box-shadow:0 0 28px rgba(255,85,85,0.25); }
    .score-ring.high     { border-color:#ff7070; box-shadow:0 0 28px rgba(255,112,112,0.2); }
    .score-ring.moderate { border-color:#ff9f0a; box-shadow:0 0 28px rgba(255,159,10,0.2); }
    .score-ring.low      { border-color:#30d158; box-shadow:0 0 28px rgba(48,209,88,0.2); }
    .score-num { font-size:1.8rem; font-weight:700; line-height:1; }
    .score-ring.critical .score-num { color:#ff5555; }
    .score-ring.high     .score-num { color:#ff7070; }
    .score-ring.moderate .score-num { color:#ff9f0a; }
    .score-ring.low      .score-num { color:#30d158; }
    .score-sub { font-size:0.62rem; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:1px; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35); margin-top:2px; }
    .result-title { font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:700; color:#ffffff; margin-bottom:10px; }
    .result-summary { font-size:0.88rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6); line-height:1.7; font-weight:300; max-width:480px; margin:0 auto; }

    /* Breakdown */
    .breakdown-row { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; padding:11px 0; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05); }
    .breakdown-row:last-child { border-bottom:none; }
    .breakdown-name { flex:1; font-size:0.82rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65); }
    .breakdown-bar-track { width:100px; height:4px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius:2px; overflow:hidden; }
    .breakdown-bar-fill { height:100%; border-radius:2px; }
    .breakdown-label { font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:700; width:52px; text-align:right; }

    /* Matrix */
    .risk-matrix { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:6px; margin-bottom:8px; }
    .matrix-cell { padding:13px 8px; border-radius:8px; text-align:center; font-size:0.78rem; font-weight:700; border:1px solid; }
    .matrix-cell.high     { background-color:rgba(255,59,48,0.1);  border-color:rgba(255,59,48,0.3);   color:#ff7070; }
    .matrix-cell.moderate { background-color:rgba(255,159,10,0.1); border-color:rgba(255,159,10,0.28); color:#ff9f0a; }
    .matrix-cell.low      { background-color:rgba(48,209,88,0.08); border-color:rgba(48,209,88,0.25);  color:#30d158; }
    .matrix-cell.active   { box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #ffffff; }
    .matrix-note { font-size:0.72rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35); }

    /* Flags / Recs */
    .flag-item {
      display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:12px;
      padding:12px 15px;
      background-color:rgba(255,59,48,0.06);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,59,48,0.18);
      border-radius:8px; font-size:0.83rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      line-height:1.5; margin-bottom:7px;
    }
    .flag-item:last-child { margin-bottom:0; }
    .flag-icon { color:#ff5555; flex-shrink:0; font-size:0.85rem; margin-top:1px; }
    .rec-item {
      display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:12px;
      padding:12px 15px;
      background-color:rgba(26,107,255,0.06);
      border:1px solid rgba(26,107,255,0.18);
      border-radius:8px; font-size:0.83rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      line-height:1.5; margin-bottom:7px;
    }
    .rec-item:last-child { margin-bottom:0; }
    .rec-num {
      width:22px; height:22px; background-color:#1a6bff; border-radius:50%;
      display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
      font-size:0.65rem; font-weight:700; color:white; flex-shrink:0;
    }

    /* CTA */
    .cta-card {
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(26,107,255,0.12),rgba(26,107,255,0.04));
      border:1px solid rgba(26,107,255,0.28);
      border-radius:12px; padding:32px 28px;
      text-align:center; margin-bottom:12px;
    }
    .cta-card h3 { font-size:1.15rem; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:8px; color:#ffffff; }
    .cta-card p { font-size:0.85rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6); line-height:1.6; margin-bottom:22px; font-weight:300; }
    .cta-privacy { font-size:0.72rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.28); margin-top:12px; }
    .btn-pdf {
      display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:8px;
      width:100%; padding:14px 28px;
      background-color:transparent; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14); border-radius:8px;
      font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif; font-size:0.9rem; font-weight:600;
      cursor:pointer; transition:all 0.2s; margin-bottom:20px;
    }
    .btn-pdf:hover { border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.3); color:#ffffff; background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.04); }
    .result-footer {
      text-align:center; padding:24px 0 0;
      font-size:0.75rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
      border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06); line-height:1.8;
    }

    @media(max-width:768px){
      nav { padding:16px 20px; }
      .progress-wrap { padding:12px 20px; top:69px; }
      .wrapper { padding:40px 20px 60px; }
      .card { padding:22px 18px; }
      .form-row { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
      .result-top { padding:28px 20px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="bg-glow"></div>
<div class="bg-grid"></div>
<div class="page">

  <nav>
    <a href="index.html"><img src="logowhite.svg.svg" alt="MLA Group"></a>
    <a href="index.html" class="nav-back">&#8592; Return to homepage</a>
  </nav>

  <div class="progress-wrap visible" id="progressWrap">
    <div class="progress-meta">
      <span class="progress-label" id="progressLabel">About You</span>
      <span class="progress-count" id="progressCount">Step 1 of 9</span>
    </div>
    <div class="progress-track">
      <div class="progress-fill" id="progressFill" style="width:11%"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrapper">

    <!-- LANDING -->
    <div class="screen" id="screen-landing">
      <div class="landing-hero">
        <div class="badge"><span class="badge-dot"></span>AI Governance &amp; Risk</div>
        <h1>Is Your Business <span class="h1-highlight">Exposed</span> to AI Risk?</h1>
        <p>Our free diagnostic assesses your organisation's AI governance maturity across 7 key areas — producing a personalised risk report aligned to UK and EU regulatory expectations.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="landing-features">
        <div class="lf-item">
          <div class="lf-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="#3d8bff" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14" stroke="#3d8bff" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
          <div class="lf-text"><h4>Completed in Under 10 Minutes</h4><p>Seven focused sections covering the areas that matter most to regulators and risk teams.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="lf-item">
          <div class="lf-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z" stroke="#3d8bff" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
          <div class="lf-text"><h4>Confidential &amp; Unbiased</h4><p>Your responses are used solely to produce your risk report — never sold or shared.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="lf-item">
          <div class="lf-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z" stroke="#3d8bff" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8" stroke="#3d8bff" stroke-width="1.8"/><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13" stroke="#3d8bff" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17" stroke="#3d8bff" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div>
          <div class="lf-text"><h4>Professional Risk Report</h4><p>On-screen results plus a downloadable PDF suitable for sharing with stakeholders.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <button class="btn-primary" onclick="goTo('screen-prescreen')">Start Free AI Risk Diagnostic &#8594;</button>
    </div>

    <!-- PRE-SCREEN -->
    <div class="screen active" id="screen-prescreen">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="section-label">About You</div>
        <div class="section-title">Tell us about yourself &amp; your organisation</div>
        <div class="section-desc">This helps us tailor your assessment results accurately. Your information is handled in confidence.</div>
        <div class="form-row">
          <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label">Full Name *</label><input type="text" class="form-input" id="ps-name" placeholder="e.g. Alex Johnson"></div>
          <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label">Job Title / Role *</label><input type="text" class="form-input" id="ps-role" placeholder="e.g. Chief Risk Officer"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label">Professional Email Address *</label><input type="email" class="form-input" id="ps-email" placeholder="you@yourcompany.com"></div>
        <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label">Organisation Name *</label><input type="text" class="form-input" id="ps-org" placeholder="e.g. Acme Financial Ltd"></div>
        <div class="form-row">
          <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label">Industry Sector *</label>
            <select class="form-select" id="ps-sector">
              <option value="">Select your sector</option>
              <option>Financial Services</option><option>Healthcare &amp; Life Sciences</option>
              <option>Legal &amp; Professional Services</option><option>Retail &amp; E-commerce</option>
              <option>Technology &amp; SaaS</option><option>Public Sector / Government</option>
              <option>Education</option><option>Manufacturing &amp; Logistics</option><option>Other</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label">Number of Employees *</label>
            <select class="form-select" id="ps-size">
              <option value="">Select range</option>
              <option>1&#8211;49</option><option>50&#8211;249</option><option>250&#8211;999</option><option>1,000+</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label class="form-label">Regulatory regime(s) that apply <span style="font-weight:400;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35)">(select all that apply)</span></label>
          <div class="options" style="margin-top:8px">
            <label class="option cb" onclick="toggleCb(this)"><span class="option-dot"></span>FCA regulated</label>
            <label class="option cb" onclick="toggleCb(this)"><span class="option-dot"></span>ICO registered / GDPR obligations</label>
            <label class="option cb" onclick="toggleCb(this)"><span class="option-dot"></span>NHS / CQC oversight</label>
            <label class="option cb" onclick="toggleCb(this)"><span class="option-dot"></span>SRA (Solicitors Regulation Authority)</label>
            <label class="option cb" onclick="toggleCb(this)"><span class="option-dot"></span>None currently</label>
            <label class="option cb" onclick="toggleCb(this)"><span class="option-dot"></span>Unsure</label>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="ps-error" class="error-msg"></div>
        <button class="btn-primary" onclick="validatePrescreen()">Continue to Assessment &#8594;</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- S1 -->
    <div class="screen" id="screen-s1">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="section-label">Section 1 of 7</div>
        <div class="section-title">AI Inventory &amp; Classification</div>
        <div class="section-desc">Identifying AI systems in scope and establishing potential regulatory exposure.</div>
        <div class="q-block">
          <div class="q-label"><span class="q-num">1.1</span>Does your organisation maintain an up-to-date inventory of all AI systems currently in use?</div>
          <div class="options" id="q1_1">
            <label class="option" onclick="pick(this,'q1_1',3)"><span class="option-dot"></span>Yes, fully maintained</label>
            <label class="option" onclick="pick(this,'q1_1',1)"><span class="option-dot"></span>Partially &#8212; some systems are documented</label>
            <label class="option" onclick="pick(this,'q1_1',0)"><span class="option-dot"></span>No formal inventory exists</label>
            <label class="option" onclick="pick(this,'q1_1',0)"><span class="option-dot"></span>Don&#8217;t know</label>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="q-block">
          <div class="q-label"><span class="q-num">1.2</span>Which of the following categories apply to your AI systems?</div>
          <div class="q-hint">Select all that apply &#8212; selections here influence your risk band</div>
          <div class="options" id="q1_2">
            <label class="option cb" onclick="toggleCb(this)" data-val="auto"><span class="option-dot"></span>Automated decision support</label>
            <label class="option cb" onclick="toggleCb(this)" data-val="profile"><span class="option-dot"></span>Customer profiling or segmentation</label>
            <label class="option cb" onclick="toggleCb(this)" data-val="credit"><span class="option-dot"></span>Customer eligibility or credit scoring</label>
            <label class="option cb" onclick="toggleCb(this)" data-val="hr"><span class="option-dot"></span>HR or recruitment support</label>
            <label class="option cb" onclick="toggleCb(this)" data-val="bio"><span class="option-dot"></span>Biometric or identity verification</label>
            <label class="option cb" onclick="toggleCb(this)" data-val="health"><span class="option-dot"></span>Health or safety related outputs</label>
            <label class="option cb" onclick="toggleCb(this)" data-val="none"><span class="option-dot"></span>None of the above</label>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="q-block">
          <div class="q-label"><span class="q-num">1.3</span>Are any AI systems in operational use that could materially affect individuals&#8217; rights, access to services, or financial outcomes?</div>
          <div class="options" id="q1_3">
            <label class="option" onclick="pick(this,'q1_3',0)"><span class="option-dot"></span>Yes</label>
            <label class="option" onclick="pick(this,'q1_3',3)"><span class="option-dot"></span>No</label>
            <label class="option" onclick="pick(this,'q1_3',1)"><span class="option-dot"></span>Unsure</label>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="q-block">
          <div class="q-label"><span class="q-num">1.4</span>Have legal or regulatory requirements specific to your sector&#8217;s use of AI been formally assessed?</div>
          <div class="options" id="q1_4">
            <label class="option" onclick="pick(this,'q1_4',3)"><span class="option-dot"></span>Yes, documented and reviewed</label>
            <label class="option" onclick="pick(this,'q1_4',1)"><span class="option-dot"></span>Yes, informally reviewed</label>
            <label class="option" onclick="pick(this,'q1_4',0)"><span class="option-dot"></span>No</label>
            <label class="option" onclick="pick(this,'q1_4',0)"><span class="option-dot"></span>Unsure</label>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="s1-error" class="error-msg"></div>
        <div class="nav-btns">
          <button class="btn-secondary" onclick="goTo('screen-prescreen')">&#8592; Back</button>
          <button class="btn-primary" onclick="next(['q1_1','q1_3','q1_4'],'s1-error','screen-s2')">Continue &#8594;</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- S2 -->
    <div class="screen" id="screen-s2">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="section-label">Section 2 of 7</div>
        <div class="section-title">Governance, Leadership &amp; Accountability</div>
        <div class="section-desc">Assessing the maturity of internal ownership and oversight structures.</div>
        <div class="q-block">
          <div class="q-label"><span class="q-num">2.1</span>Are AI systems clearly classified by risk level within your organisation?</div>
          <div class="options" id="q2_1">
            <label class="option" onclick="pick(this,'q2_1',3)"><span class="option-dot"></span>Yes, with a formal classification framework</label>
            <label class="option" onclick="pick(this,'q2_1',1)"><span class="option-dot"></span>Partially &#8212; some classification exists</label>
            <label class="option" onclick="pick(this,'q2_1',0)"><span class="option-dot"></span>No formal classification</label>
            <label class="option" onclick="pick(this,'q2_1',2)"><span class="option-dot"></span>Not applicable at this stage</label>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="q-block">
          <div class="q-label"><span class="q-num">2.2</span>Is there a formally appointed individual or function responsible for AI governance?</div>
          <div class="options" id="q2_2">
            <label class="option" onclick="pick(this,'q2_2',3)"><span class="option-dot"></span>Yes, clearly documented with defined responsibilities</label>
            <label class="option" onclick="pick(this,'q2_2',1)"><span class="option-dot"></span>Yes, but informally arranged</label>
            <label class="option" onclick="pick(this,'q2_2',0)"><span class="option-dot"></span>No</label>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="q-block">
          <div class="q-label"><span class="q-num">2.3</span>Does executive leadership receive regular reporting on AI risk and performance?</div>
          <div class="options" id="q2_3">
            <label class="option" onclick="pick(this,'q2_3',3)"><span class="option-dot"></span>Yes, quarterly or more frequently</label>
            <label class="option" onclick="pick(this,'q2_3',1)"><span class="option-dot"></span>Yes, occasionally</label>
            <label class="option" onclick="pick(this,'q2_3',0)"><span class="option-dot"></span>No</label>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="q-block">
          <div class="q-label"><span class="q-num">2.4</span>Are documented policies in place governing the use of AI systems?</div>
          <div class="options" id="q2_4">
            <label class="option" onclick="pick(this,'q2_4',3)"><span class="option-dot"></span>Comprehensive policies in place</label>
            <label class="option" onclick="pick(this,'q2_4',1)"><span class="option-dot"></span>Partial policies exist</label>
            <label class="option" onclick="pick(this,'q2_4',0)"><span class="option-dot"></span>None in place</label>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="q-block">
          <div class="q-label"><span class="q-num">2.5</span>Are roles and responsibilities for AI oversight explicitly defined across risk, compliance, and technical functions?</div>
          <div class="options" id="q2_5">
            <label class="option" onclick="pick(this,'q2_5',3)"><span class="option-dot"></span>Yes, clearly defined and documented</label>
            <label class="option" onclick="pick(this,'q2_5',1)"><span class="option-dot"></span>Partially defined</label>
            <label class="option" onclick="pick(this,'q2_5',0)"><span class="option-dot"></span>No</label>
          </div>
